From 8a48ff51917bec272f85cc6ed647d1a7d06293e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devcore94 <devcore94@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 05:47:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] unica: mods: knoxpatch: adapt ICD bypass to One UI 9.0

Adapted from Devcore94's original ICDFix_8.5 patch for the Android 17/One UI 9
services.jar layout. The One UI 9 port is maintained by At30c; the original
author and implementation are preserved here for credit. Keep the 9.0
AttestParameterSpec fields and ABI intact, remove the
obsolete callers that only force the flag to false, and make the attestation
argument builder skip Samsung's verifiable-integrity KeyMint tag.

The field layout is intentionally preserved because One UI 9 still shares
these classes across the framework and samsungkeystoreutils bootclasspath.
This patch only changes framework-side request construction; it cannot reset
the hardware-backed Knox/TEE compromise state.

Original-work: ICDFix_8.5 by Devcore94
Adapted-by: At30c <PabloAtsoc9993@outlook.com>
